{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "847d959660313e711c76f59c1e3091b8bcad172ddde3f8d8c0e2a6cede8f5855", "ja": "雑誌の『結婚したいアイドルランキング』に\n一喜一憂する、風花・莉緒・このみ・歌織・\n千鶴。プロデューサーは『ハピマリ』の仕事\nが765プロにきたことを伝える。ウェディ\nングの仕事と聞き、5人はすっかりやる気に。", "zh": "风花、莉绪、木实、歌织和千鹤\n看到杂志上『想和她结婚的偶像排行榜』，\n心情变得七上八下，此时制作人向大家转达\n765艺能接到了『幸福婚礼』的工作。\n听说工作跟婚礼有关，五人都干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "b026075d598d78813ebd2e49fbddd8609c0f216ecd772bbb5dd29d3887aba3c3", "ja": "{$P$}くん、まだかしらね。\nもう打ち合わせの時間なんだけど～。", "zh": "{$P$}还没来吗？\n开会的时间都已经到了耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b28a8c63b1b12f503b25e6dc975e7b627ab8500b316a92cbf65914c797733ef4", "ja": "前のお仕事が押してるんじゃないですか？\n{$P$}さん、忙しい人だから……。", "zh": "可能是上一个工作还没结束吧？\n毕竟{$P$}先生很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "9d8b21fbc1d152b4825f0c3f4f51a97685cd3b149474fc26df093d37368d0717", "ja": "ふふっ。暇なら莉緒ちゃんも一緒に見てみる？\nこの雑誌で、気になる投票企画やってるわよ、ほら。", "zh": "呵呵，莉绪没事做的话要不要一起来看？\n这本杂志有个令人在意的投票企划喔，你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "f5f42f51ee1b281506e81dd6cbdc32c6a4733fbc774bac0658b7315798d1e2eb", "ja": "なになに？　えーと……。\n『結婚したいアイドルランキングトップ100』！？", "zh": "什么什么？我瞧瞧……\n『想和她结婚的偶像排行榜TOP100』！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee4e02a324e4266dfd52d31f29c8ef2d4a8a04647ea410457af23a544501d029", "ja": "何これ、すっごく面白そうじゃない！\nほら、歌織ちゃんも千鶴ちゃんも！　見て見て！", "zh": "这是什么，感觉超有趣的！\n小歌和千鹤也快点过来看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "bb65af36b25aa8be5806369ac1501239496a0ad7181f259ee7c00cc2f0161888", "ja": "結婚したいアイドル……。も、もしかして、\nわたくし達もランキングに入っているんですの！？", "zh": "想和她结婚的偶像……？该、该不会，\n我们也有在排行榜里面吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "f37083fe53013f22611d47e50c6b7ba6b45b2811eefb57bb4b42ce8dd912a4de", "ja": "でも、アイドルなのに結婚だなんて……。\nい、いいのかしら？", "zh": "可是，偶像谈要结婚……\n没、没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "d0a3a07b15086bcbf5b38a2e0355c0d8985e48d24f471796444a880af1141eed", "ja": "いいのいいの、こういうのは遊びなんだから～♪\nあーっ、風花ちゃん、トップ10に入ってるじゃない！", "zh": "没问题啦，这些都是好玩而已～♪\n啊──！风花有在TOP10里面耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4fba4edac8a2d8bd70721f7291b4489f984e26c8af9dfe108ec2bc58a42da65c", "ja": "えっ！？　わ、私がですか！？\nトップ100にも入ってないと思ってたのに……。", "zh": "咦！？我、我吗！？\n我还以为自己连TOP100都排不进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "a7f55867a1413f300f143d3865cc29b75cb00f8ed0aa90b3a80639521b68f33b", "ja": "コメントに投票理由も書いてあるわね。\nえ～っと、風花ちゃんのコメントは～。", "zh": "留言里面还有写投票理由喔。\n我看看，对风花的留言是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "775e1fe50232df2e20e8dbee602e7db0408cee22c01d6a70bbd6feca58b7e1a4", "ja": "『癒されそう』『包容力がありそう』『優しそう』、\n『むちぽ』……コホン。", "zh": "『感觉会被疗愈』、『感觉很有包容力』、\n『感觉很温柔』、『身材丰』……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "29b56d939c2771a8a404b4eabf6fc317d3645969831d7393a7c5eaff1c05a2c7", "ja": "そうなんだ……。ふふ、なんだかくすぐったいですけど\n投票してもらえたのは、素直に嬉しいです♪", "zh": "这样啊……呵呵，虽然有点难为情，\n不过看到读者投票给我，真的很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7774343bf4af6839e2190e14c54992fc3c2f6b9664c6968cc05ea6cadad87026", "ja": "お嫁さんかぁ。これがきっかけで、\n正統派のお仕事が来るといいな……♪", "zh": "新娘啊～如果能借此有\n正统派的工作上门就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "051ca73c71881a9c75c6224e03dc21e0df10cdb17558b64855a3bbe0099be5c7", "ja": "そうなるといいわね♪\n……あっ。上位に歌織ちゃんもいたわよ！", "zh": "希望会有呢♪\n……啊！前几名还有歌织耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "e752f7d8121835ce0b6d515919c8a2f3b21a1f76f6554121c5f09ec6ec313f0e", "ja": "まあ！　でも、私がまだこんなに子どもなんだって\nわかってしまったら、ガッカリされてしまいそう……。", "zh": "哇！不过，要是大家知道我其实这么幼稚的话，\n应该会很失望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9fafc4a38e8b1d677d507200d02d185c613f9836fbdec6e1dc20604666b5f68", "ja": "あら、歌織さんは立派な大人の女性ですもの。\n皆様の目は確かだと思いますわ！", "zh": "哎呀，歌织可是位很成熟的女性。\n本小姐认为大家的眼光并没有错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "2ff97433689d631e4ec78ba78db0167d3548d899cc805467b12a22210a27d262", "ja": "それから……。あっ、美奈子ちゃんも上位なのね！\nまだ高校生なのに、すごいわ～。", "zh": "然后……啊！美奈子也名列前茅！\n明明还只是高中生，真厉害～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "4bac8719725fd9e541a3b6ef6738e7360c8a6dd5e5c80f63026f33032cf25b84", "ja": "やっぱり、男の子の気持ちをつかむには、\nまず胃袋からってことなのかしら？", "zh": "果然要抓住男生的心，\n就是要先抓住他的胃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "5db5a2398282b4106b67e18e4637787680003e58ea5ad8d0152fe4ad0ca85736", "ja": "私と千鶴ちゃんは……\nうん、まあまあの順位ってところかしらね。", "zh": "我跟千鹤……\n嗯，名次还算可以啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "19fc19b38ccdbd40b1bab91cada78586114e537a83d753d135f804db0e181465", "ja": "今のところ、結婚は考えていませんけれど……投票して\nくださった皆様のお気持ちは嬉しいですわね♪", "zh": "虽然本小姐目前没有考虑结婚……\n不过还是很高兴大家投票的这份心意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "99be6913b24d30a88c6b1668af3832ff64e49b51bf2abdf733fb678b6bbf5ed0", "ja": "……あら？　最後まで見たんだけど……\n私、もしかしてランクインしてない！？", "zh": "……奇怪？已经看到最后了……\n我……该不会没有进榜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "d4235a01de9e441c46a4ea6496a89d9aa387c5e323a8fc4d71dd22727cda2550", "ja": "え～っと………………。\nそうねえ、ここにはランクインしてないみたい。", "zh": "我瞧瞧………………\n对耶，莉绪好像没在这个排行榜上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "f256451c6bfe0063cc338abfd1fe4507b21f4beb985bfc009b4b9b43ff1711b8", "ja": "えええええっ！　ひどいひどい～！\nこのみ姉さん、あんまりじゃない！", "zh": "咦咦咦咦咦！好过份好过份～！\n木实姊，实在太伤人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "db155bd5441e171e3b3aee59a4c5adc97e20427e9431de740b28da57b72086ee", "ja": "わ、私は関係ないでしょ！？\n仕方ないじゃない、そういうランキングなんだから……", "zh": "跟、跟我没关系吧！？\n有什么办法，这就是那种排行榜嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "c1e15bdf1060153b3d322a6a6ff4d8f47edb39eba000c94576f43dfbbec2d76a", "ja": "も～、どういうこと！？\nみんな、私のなにが不満なのよ～っ！！", "zh": "讨厌啦～什么意思！？\n大家是对我哪里不满意啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7e701c5f3f4bebd0519b0b3ecdcbb8f36fb365216eec9c41359f8bd7ef40cd3c", "ja": "あ、ほら、こっちの『飲みに行きたい女友達』\nランキングには載ってますよ♪　しかもトップ10に！", "zh": "啊，你看，你有在『想一起去喝酒的女性朋友』\n排行榜上喔♪而且还是前10名！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "703c265937078c31532fa5106433b4480c6ecf7541e788c6d4922ff025204128", "ja": "トップ10！？　……でも、女友達……友達かあ。\nまあ、友達でもいいけど……。ううん、よくないわ！", "zh": "前10名！？可是……女性朋友……只是朋友啊……\n虽然朋友也很好啦……不对，才不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1027_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ea3f89994d5001dbdb66e84c198334bce7ca23bfc0fd4fdc76a15cba1c30e48d", "ja": "すみません、遅くなりました！\n公演の打ち合わせが長引いてしまって……。", "zh": "不好意思，我迟到了！\n公演的会议时间有点耽搁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "e350be446278dd41fd5febb1476137207f1912a1ec8215bf81d2dd76811bc3ab", "ja": "{$P$}くん！　ねえ、私と結婚したら\n毎日楽しいわよね！？　私と結婚したいわよね！？", "zh": "{$P$}！问你喔，要是跟我结婚的话，\n每天都会很开心对吧！？你想跟我结婚对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3435f502e9d00c75015d2557184d74989c73552c81abee13d0b3c453a04e0bb4", "ja": "け、結婚！？　し、したいかって……\nいやちょっと待ってくれ！　話が見えない！！", "zh": "结、结婚！？你问、问我想不想……\n不对，先等一下！我抓不到你的重点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fc87f7f827c51ae4b5b8e856bd2ae5f2c6bb06c05cb4086b15992732856fed49", "ja": "なるほど……。ま、莉緒と一緒にいるのは楽しいだろう\nけど、結婚はそれだけが問題じゃないだろうしな。", "zh": "原来如此……嗯～跟莉绪在一起应该会很开心没错，\n不过结婚看的也不是只有这个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "88f2184f757a7e143d7f0c325e98297a2404913055a44c8976a06ef892e1412f", "ja": "そういうものなの？\n結婚って奥が深いのね……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n结婚好深奥啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "537d5f24ed26b9d75f7d1dd0602bbf69365aced5ba0dba6ed1f3109ce567a07a", "ja": "ああ、深いらしい……。でも、そういうことなら、\n今回の企画はいい勉強になるかもな。", "zh": "对啊，好像很深奥……不过照这样看来，\n在这次的企划中或许可以学到很多喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8c06b7352cb79f419d44c4f90c224914d10f4cedfb9267491ad055198aa5630b", "ja": "というわけで……実は、765プロのアイドル達で、\n『ハピマリ』のモデルを務めることが決まった！", "zh": "所以说……其实，已经确定要由765艺能的偶像们\n担任『幸福婚礼』的模特儿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "367dec1b499b4621afd5e9331adf8e01d5f4ff2b7e58f3d511e1c887447cac02", "ja": "そしてこの5人には『ハピマリ』のCMにも出て、\nCMソングも歌ってもらおうと思ってる！", "zh": "然后我想找你们五个人拍『幸福婚礼』的广告，\n并且演唱广告主题曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
