{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cb4907c589c85a0f98a1d51cc053acab5d861149b9d15b827840e6737ce493ed", "ja": "『ハピマリ』のモデルってことは……。\nもしかして、ウェディングドレスが着られるんですか？", "zh": "当『幸福婚礼』的模特儿……\n难道说……我们可以穿婚纱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "21aebf2356e6d4fa3ebf745733568f7e37b709e3e3b4bc5f580975580b530e29", "ja": "もちろん、撮影用の衣装だけどな。\n他に、ステージで歌うための衣装も作ることになる。", "zh": "当然，不过是拍摄用的服装就是了。\n另外还会订制在台上唱歌用的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "5509ef974c5f108322149a6606ad2ace33d1dc24ef0fc33076418b312ffaf4f5", "ja": "準備に撮影にレッスンに、忙しくなると思うけど。\nみんな、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "要准备、要拍摄还要训练，应该会变得很忙。\n拜托大家啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1045_052kao", "source_sha256": "30b4241febc59bdf70c36c81881253be936e2c34191cda08a0bcaf7e50c325e8", "ja": "はい、がんばります♪　ふふっ、まさかこんなに早く\nウェディングドレスが着られるなんて……。", "zh": "好，我会加油的♪呵呵！\n没想到这么快就能穿上婚纱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1046_038chz", "source_sha256": "245d0f929a87250b9887feb7890cef95f71b9ca73462f83e3f282ef05bc94a35", "ja": "わたくしは、以前にお仕事で着たことがありますが……\n素敵なドレスは、何度着ても嬉しいものですわ！", "zh": "本小姐以前因为工作关系有穿过……\n但美丽的婚纱不论穿几次都会很高兴呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "3bd1d039f7065ec8ccfa2b99e72d4a93cfb1fcb48ff7b6a9bdc0e07ccf9204cf", "ja": "ふふ、仕方ないわね！　765プロで一番アダルティな\n私に任せなさい♪　セクシーに着こなしてみせるわ！", "zh": "呵呵，真是没办法！就交给765艺能里\n最有成熟韵味的我吧♪我会把婚纱穿得很性感的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1048_041fuk", "source_sha256": "81d29d2356caae0d5896a26b2ad0c10633f82bc01e3b6a9b5091baf3744ce117", "ja": "ウェディングドレスかぁ……。やっぱり一度は\n憧れちゃいますよね。ふふっ、楽しみだなぁ……♪", "zh": "婚纱啊……果然还是会梦想能穿一次看看呢。\n呵呵！好期待喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "d4a134eb7a85162962044f6398db0e7d3bc7227c2c9539ac4a96cbbe8c7b1e00", "ja": "ホント、ちょうど良かったわ。私の花嫁姿で、全国の\n男の子たちの心をわしづかみにしてみせるんだから！", "zh": "这工作真是来得太刚好了。\n我要用我的新娘模样紧紧抓住全国男生们的心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "5300e0c9f5d4e4bc29edbfa84b65925d51624ec3095492795493257e5d5621ac", "ja": "（テーマがテーマだけに、みんなのモチベーションも\nかなり高いみたいだ）", "zh": "（毕竟是这种主题，\n看来大家都干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
